{
  "uid": "ids-deteccion-ataques",
  "title": "1. Centro de deteccion de ataques",
  "description": "Resumen general de alertas de todas las fuentes",
  "tags": [
    "ids",
    "laboratorio"
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "timezone": "browser",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "10s",
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "Inicio de ataque",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "red",
        "type": "tags",
        "tags": [
          "ataque"
        ],
        "matchAny": true,
        "limit": 100
      }
    ]
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Otros dashboards",
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "ids"
      ],
      "asDropdown": true,
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": true
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 2
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Centro de deteccion de ataques**: alertas de **Suricata** (escaneo de puertos y DoS en el laboratorio Docker) y de **pt-agent** (ACL y Port Security en Cisco Packet Tracer), centralizadas en Loki. Las lineas rojas punteadas marcan el **inicio real** de cada ataque; la distancia hasta la barra es el **tiempo de deteccion**."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Alertas totales",
      "description": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 2,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({event_type=\"alert\"}[$__range]))",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "legendFormat": "Total",
          "queryType": "instant"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "noValue": "0",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "purple"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": ""
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Escaneo de puertos",
      "description": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 4,
        "y": 2,
